<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<?mso-application progid="Excel.Sheet"?><Workbook xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet" xmlns:ss="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet">
    <Worksheet ss:Name="Dia">
      <Table>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">zho</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Comments</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_death_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">退下，卑微的凡人</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Disc world reference.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">COWER, BRIEF MORTAL.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_death_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">别出声！你没死，你还在这</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">SILENCE! YOU ARE NOT DEAD, YET YOU ARE HERE.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_death_intro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">看起来你注定要受到无尽的诅咒</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">IT SEEMS THAT ETERNAL DAMNATION IS THE ONLY PATH FOR YOU.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_death_outro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">吾辈承认，汝等很强大，人类…咳咳</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">now the outro; the player has won the battle.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">YOU ARE POWERFUL, MORTAL.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_death_outro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">好吧，咱不咬文嚼字了…你"真"走运！
咱其实是一家旅行社的股东，
咱会把你送回你的世界，而且是免费的说。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">AS "LUCK" WOULD HAVE IT, I AM PART OWNER OF A TRAVEL AGENCY. I SHALL RETURN YOU TO YOUR WORLD -- FREE OF CHARGE.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_death_outro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">另外，如果你需要帮助的话，
给咱挂个电话就好，
[P=1.5]拨打120，然后转死神热线。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">please make it a typical salesman's telephone number</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">OH, AND IF YOU EVER NEED ME AGAIN, JUST GIVE ME A CALL  [P=1.5]555-DEATH.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_vlad_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">啊，那可不算太好……
你刚刚怎么不说明一下情况？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Well, that didn't go so well... Why didn't you just explain the situation?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_vlad_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">啊，好了，就过去的问题争吵没有任何意义
看起来你最后到达了#Location_NH;-死亡之地。
对你来说，还好我认识这些土地的统治者-#Boss_N12;，
除了他的常规工作外，他还是一个旅行社的部分所有者</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Ah well, no point in bickering over past mistakes -- it seems that you have ended up in #Location_NH;, the land of the dead. And it's a good thing for you that I know the ruler of these lands -- #Boss_N12;. Who in addition to his regular job is part owner of a travel agency.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_vlad_intro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你找到了死者之城，然后大踏步径直走了进去。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You just have to locate the city of the dead, and then pass right on through.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NI_Text_vlad_end</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#Boss_N12;就在前面，
快告诉他你来这儿的目的</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#Boss_N12; is just up ahead. -- If you just explain the situation to him, I'm sure he will help you out...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
